name marginfit
category Package
revision 48281
shortdesc Improved margin notes
relocated 1
longdesc This package fixes various bugs with the margin paragraph
longdesc implementation of LaTeX. Those bugs include margin notes that
longdesc are attached to the wrong side as well as those that stick out
longdesc of the bottom of the page. This package provides a drop-in
longdesc replacement solution.
